{
  "name": "Weekly cleanup sweep (Enterprise)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "weeks" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Every week"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "endpointUrl": "https://your-unleash-instance/api/admin/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "search",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={\n  \"queries\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"flags\",\n      \"project\": \"default\",\n      \"stages\": [\"completed\"],\n      \"limit\": 50\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [224, 0],
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Find completed flags (MCP)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "results[0].flags",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [448, 0],
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "One flag at a time"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "endpointUrl": "https://your-unleash-instance/api/admin/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "inspect",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={\n  \"queries\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"flag_exposure_metrics\",\n      \"project\": \"default\",\n      \"flag\": \"{{ $json.name }}\",\n      \"environment\": \"production\",\n      \"hoursBack\": 168\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [672, 0],
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Check last 7 days of traffic (MCP)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-8000-000000000010",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.results[0].totals.requests }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [896, 0],
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Still getting traffic?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "unleash-cleanup",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=:broom: `{{ $('One flag at a time').item.json.name }}` is marked *completed* but still had {{ $json.results[0].totals.requests }} evaluations in the last 7 days in production. Created by {{ $('One flag at a time').item.json.createdBy }}. Worth a look before archiving it.",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [1120, 0],
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Flag the flag",
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "placeholder",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly cleanup sweep (Enterprise)\n\nOnce a week, search Unleash for flags in the **completed** lifecycle stage, then check each one's traffic over the last 7 days through the MCP server. Flags that are marked completed but still get evaluated are worth a second look before anyone archives them.\n\n**Requires Unleash Enterprise** — the MCP server is Enterprise-only. [Start a trial](https://www.getunleash.io/plans/enterprise-payg).\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Turn on the Remote MCP Server under Admin in your Unleash instance, and connect a Bearer personal access token credential to both MCP nodes.\n2. Change `project: \"default\"` in the search step to your project, and `environment: \"production\"` in the inspect step if you track a different environment.\n3. Connect your own Slack credential and set the channel.\n\nVerified against the `unleash-mcp` source: `search` (kind `flags`) returns `{ results: [{ kind, total, flags: [...] }] }`, and `inspect` (kind `flag_exposure_metrics`) returns `{ results: [{ totals: { requests, enabled }, ... }] }` — `totals.requests` is evaluations whether or not the flag was enabled. Not run end to end against a live server, since this repo doesn't have Enterprise access.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [0, -280],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-0002-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every week": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Find completed flags (MCP)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Find completed flags (MCP)": {
      "main": [
